The coordinator, SQLite journal and DSH executor were extracted from SurfCore's
superagent integration. Runtime identifiers were renamed to Chopsticks and an
optional result callback routes results through the host's canonical event log.
The narrow vendor engine closure retains its own DeepSeek Harness MIT notice
and upstream revision in tasks/vendor/LICENSE and PROVENANCE.json. No runtime
SurfCore installation is required.

